# Source Code Licensing Status / 源代码授权状态

This repository is **not currently released under an open-source license**.

The baseline source was imported from the repository at
<https://gitee.com/cswl2020/pic>. At the time of the 2026-08-03 M0 review,
the imported source tree contained no `LICENSE` file and no other explicit
copyright licence grant. The absence of a licence does not place a work in the
public domain.

Accordingly, this file grants **no permission** to use, copy, modify,
redistribute, sublicense, publish, or commercially exploit the first-party
source code. Any such permission must come from the relevant copyright holder
in a separate, verifiable written agreement, or from rights independently
available under applicable law.

Copyright in upstream material remains with its respective author or owner.
Copyright in later contributions remains with the respective contributor
unless assigned or licensed by a separate written agreement. Repository
access, a Git remote, a commit, or technical ability to build the software is
not evidence of copyright ownership or permission to distribute it.

Before any public or commercial distribution, the project maintainers must:

1. establish and record the chain of title for the upstream source;
2. obtain a written licence or assignment covering modification and
   redistribution, or replace the affected source with code that can be
   demonstrably distributed;
3. select and publish an appropriate first-party licence; and
4. preserve all independently applicable third-party notices and licence
   terms listed in `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

Third-party components are not covered by this notice. They remain available
under their own licences.

---

本仓库目前**未以任何开源许可证发布**。

基线代码来自 <https://gitee.com/cswl2020/pic>。在 2026-08-03 的 M0
核查中，导入的源码树内没有 `LICENSE` 文件，也没有发现明确的著作权许可声明。
没有许可证并不代表代码属于公有领域。

因此，本文件**不授予**使用、复制、修改、再分发、再许可、公开发布或商业利用
第一方源码的任何权限。相关权限必须由著作权人通过可核验的单独书面协议授予，
或由适用法律另行赋予。

上游材料的权利仍归各自作者或权利人所有；后续贡献的权利仍归各贡献者所有，
除非另有书面转让或许可。能够访问仓库、设置 Git 远程地址、创建提交或成功构建，
均不能证明代码权属或公开分发权限。

任何公开或商业发布前，维护者必须完成权属链确认、取得覆盖修改与再分发的书面
授权（或替换相关代码）、确定第一方许可证，并保留
`THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` 中全部适用的第三方声明与许可条款。

第三方组件不受本声明重新许可，仍分别遵循其自身许可证。
